Description: Chinese Pinyin on-screen keyboard for Phosh
 Myna is a small Phosh/Droidian on-screen keyboard focused on Chinese
 Pinyin input through Rime. It provides a Wayland input-method-v2 panel
 and integrates with the Phosh OSK alternatives system.
